# One CI gate, one file (issue #991).
ci_gate check-requirement-extraction
  stage web
  description "The requirements js/agentic/crate/requirement_extraction.mjs lists for every cached issue in data/benchmarks/issue-requirements/ keep their recall and precision against the reviewed rows of docs/requirements/issue-NNNN-*.md at or above the floors in data/meta/text-capability-ratchet.lino."
  run "node scripts/measure-requirement-extraction.mjs --check"
  justification "PR #1188 (R1188-U20) asks Formal AI to list the exact requirements of an issue without an LLM; the benchmark is the repository's own reviewed requirement rows, and the floors may only rise."
